{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":125109,\"title\":\"Dragonworld\",\"tagline\":\"Out of this world and into your heart\",\"overview\":\"A young man must risk his life to save his fire-breathing friend from the unscrupulous owner of an amusement park.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/36RXGobVYfVXoyj4ip6EDROUHxk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lblAulQoT7jFe4jZ6q1McMXtuH0.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"voteCount\":28,\"year\":1994,\"runtime\":86,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Ted Nicolaou\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":45989,\"name\":\"Ted Nicolaou\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bIgHoWJVh4d2hnThSV2yTgyrLPo.jpg\"},{\"id\":55961,\"name\":\"Courtland Mead\",\"character\":\"Young Johnny McGowan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/71Npi8B3YfSbOOXo5uvT5Nhn3Ah.jpg\"},{\"id\":53351,\"name\":\"Janet Henfrey\",\"character\":\"Miss Twittingham\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Qu5XwphEhpLjdAPaTBIoQs0uKB.jpg\"},{\"id\":53815,\"name\":\"Andrew Keir\",\"character\":\"Angus McGowan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4FeHARcXJTu2TpUxy1eAoPR3Eim.jpg\"},{\"id\":14466,\"name\":\"Lila Kaye\",\"character\":\"Mrs. Cosgrove\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qHemjOuXxcTL2CnASDxLeXWmdzA.jpg\"},{\"id\":39970,\"name\":\"Alastair Mackenzie\",\"character\":\"John McGowan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/blGkrAkxxdzEs9NZnj9f21rzpjz.jpg\"},{\"id\":95939,\"name\":\"Brittney Powell\",\"character\":\"Beth Armstrong\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xDnCZiA9t38obKj48owSd2xGX1w.jpg\"},{\"id\":73960,\"name\":\"John Calvin\",\"character\":\"Bob Armstrong\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4kvMrEC5TQgCnHXLp7ab3H9nBmX.jpg\"},{\"id\":14465,\"name\":\"John Woodvine\",\"character\":\"Lester MacIntyre\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mqNKneqT3W4YEfW35BN1UJ1kJoy.jpg\"},{\"id\":6978,\"name\":\"Jim Dunk\",\"character\":\"Brownie McGee\",\"photo\":null}],\"franchise\":{\"name\":\"Dragonworld Collection\",\"parts\":[{\"id\":125109,\"title\":\"Dragonworld\",\"year\":1994,\"rating\":5.2},{\"id\":220426,\"title\":\"Dragonworld: The Legend Continues\",\"year\":1999,\"rating\":6}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7btGYblBnfAaw713WvFM0Kimc7.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":791523,\"title\":\"Wildwood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/snFM00mpNAfUzUtkdEW0uDEvXA0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sl5NJ1vtyhP9Vr88bB4blULsJYp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prue and her classmate Curtis are drawn into a magical forest filled with enchanted creatures, loyal allies, and formidable adversaries as they embark on a desperate quest to rescue Prue's abducted baby brother from a murder of crows led by a mysterious woman named Alexandra.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1108427,\"title\":\"Moana\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaet1xQ2nxrG0V1Ep9T20ZMNEIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teenage Moana answers the Ocean's call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":83533,\"title\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bRBeSHfGHwkEpImlhxPmOcUsaeg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u8DU5fkLoM5tTRukzPC31oGPxaQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the wake of the devastating war against the RDA and the loss of their eldest son, Jake Sully and Neytiri face a new threat on Pandora: the Ash People, a violent and power-hungry Na'vi tribe led by the ruthless Varang. Jake's family must fight for their survival and the future of Pandora in a conflict that pushes them to their emotional and physical limits.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":671,\"title\":\"Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wuMc08IPKEatf9rnMNXvIDxqP4W.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5jkE2SzR5uR2egEb1rRhF22JyWN.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Harry Potter has lived under the stairs at his aunt and uncle's house his whole life. But on his 11th birthday, he learns he's a powerful wizard—with a place waiting for him at the Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. As he learns to harness his newfound powers with the help of the school's kindly headmaster, Harry uncovers the truth about his parents' deaths—and about the villain who's to blame.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":120,\"title\":\"The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiwc338EoBgS4sEI2ixAny4KQKg.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1226863,\"title\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Having thwarted Bowser's previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir's crusade.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844234,\"title\":\"A Sentença\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jWkZzzr0ZK5BmHxp2QMvF3ITsQn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dMJ45ukXctpFHOgGAxYt72jG2jn.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12437,\"title\":\"Underworld: Rise of the Lycans\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yW9gF7rGn8EoV8B8rxOx1xjxVZf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/agQrynTKEWWKAowcf7Dvb3I2F9A.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A prequel to the first two Underworld films, this fantasy explains the origins of the feud between the Vampires and the Lycans. Aided by his secret love, Sonja, courageous Lucian leads the Lycans in battle against brutal Vampire king Viktor. Determined to break the king's enslavement of his people, Lucian faces off against the Death Dealer army in a bid for Lycan independence.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"b_ZlchZjkPc\",\"name\":\"Dragonworld REMASTERED | Trailer | Courtland Mead | Janet Henfrey | Stuart Campbell\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}